Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:08.73,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:12.32,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:17.73,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward! Hands up!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:30.69,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,"I'm almost there, just a little further and I'll have the answer."
