Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:38.39,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's what I believed as I sailed into this new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:34.27,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230,430)}Quality-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:38.39,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(790,480)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:45.91,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's right, the pieces of our dreams are joined together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.62,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,492)}Video editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:53.96,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're connected by unwavering bonds, let's head for a bright future!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:58.63,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:02.44,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:05.84,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:09.85,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.33,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.37,0:01:13.55,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:15.00,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:16.85,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:20.45,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.49,0:01:24.69,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:31.09,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We drift forward, riding the waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.13,0:01:35.35,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,meeting people and saying goodbye, then doing it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:39.60,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,all under this flag...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.32,0:01:44.71,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Pain I don't want to forget is kept in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:48.22,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,There was a day when I softly carved it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:51.89,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone take my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:54.82,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I grasp it tightly in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:59.72,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:03.39,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:06.69,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.72,0:02:10.86,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:12.24,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
