Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.58,0:02:15.94,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:17.73,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
