Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:36.00,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,0)}名為桃之助的龍\N與威脅般的雪果實能力者！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:43.44,Captions small,Location,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(675,0)}C棟－地下垃圾場
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.91,0:02:39.44,Main,Luffy,0,0,100,,{\an8}桃之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:41.55,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,100,,{\an8}那正是我的名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:46.09,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我以前聽過這個名字…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.09,0:02:47.55,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我是在哪裡聽到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.55,0:02:49.88,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我怎麼會知道。\N你大概是把我認成別人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:52.10,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,更重要的是，你是不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:57.06,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,別流口水了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:03:00.21,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我不是食物。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.21,0:03:02.88,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,與其被你吃掉，我寧願吃掉你。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:05.01,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,100,,{\an8}克制一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.38,0:03:06.52,Captions small,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(550,0)}桃之助（龍）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:11.92,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,咦？桃之助一定是卡在這附近某處，用他的屁在說話！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:14.02,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，你在哪裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:16.16,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,你…你以為你在幹什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:20.28,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,咦？！一條鰻魚在跟我說話？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:24.65,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,別流口水了！我不是鰻魚！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.69,0:03:30.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你也餓得不行了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:32.86,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,別說傻話。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:38.07,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,區區十天沒進食\N怎麼可能讓一名武士的肚子叫起來。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:39.24,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,十天？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:42.93,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,你是誰，你在這裡做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.93,0:03:46.90,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我是魯夫，將要成為海賊王的男人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:50.13,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,海…海…海…海賊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:53.03,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,別撒謊了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.03,0:03:56.90,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,海賊應該更巨大\N體重至少有三百公斤。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:04:00.21,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,而且還會更強悍、更兇猛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:03.25,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我才不在乎。不過鰻魚啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:04.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你怎麼{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:05.50,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我的名字是桃之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:10.48,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,原來如此，看來你也是個外來者。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:15.13,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我對這個地方僅有的了解\N就是這裡住著許多生病的孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:22.86,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我不知道這是什麼樣的島\N也不知道我身上發生了什麼事。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.07,0:04:28.81,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,這一切始於我偷偷潛上某艘船的時候。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:38.32,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我並不想跟那些孩子扯上關係，他們卻待我如此親切。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:43.34,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,我們現在有飯吃了。你不吃嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:49.08,Flashbacks,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我是武士，不接受他人的施捨。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:55.48,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,即便他們對我如此親切，我仍然戒心十足，所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:57.80,Flashbacks,Random boy,0,0,0,,我把你的飯帶來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:05:00.67,Flashbacks,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我說了我不需要！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:05.51,Flashbacks,Random boy,0,0,0,,你該吃點東西。我們都離開了自己的父母。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:09.09,Flashbacks,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,你們誰也不可能懂我的心情！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.65,0:05:06.61,Secondary,Random girl,0,0,0,,{\i1}我們應該好好相處{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.98,0:05:13.98,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,我是凱薩主人。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:16.08,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,來，進去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:19.70,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,從今以後，這裡就是你的遊樂場。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:23.90,Flashbacks,Konbu,0,0,0,,喂，你叫什麼名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:27.37,Flashbacks,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我…沒有名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:30.57,Flashbacks,Mocha,0,0,0,,這裡有些點心。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.57,0:05:33.05,Flashbacks,Mocha,0,0,0,,請自便。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.05,0:05:34.02,Flashbacks,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我不需要！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:35.38,Flashbacks,Mocha,0,0,0,,那來點糖果如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:36.56,Flashbacks,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我不需要！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:41.22,Flashbacks,Yellow suit guy,0,0,0,,什麼？有個孩子逃走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:45.28,Flashbacks,Yellow suit guy 2,0,0,0,,是啊，可是根據名單，\N沒有人不見了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:46.19,Flashbacks,Yellow guy 3,0,0,0,,真奇怪。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.31,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,喂，你。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:24.41,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,嗯，所以你就是桃之助君？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:27.85,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,這是秘密房間。\N你不該待在這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.85,0:06:31.99,Flashbacks,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,別再來纏著我。你給我添麻煩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:34.88,Flashbacks,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我正在找出去的路。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:38.16,Flashbacks,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我要離開這裡。\N有件事是我非做不可的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:42.81,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,一定很辛苦，但這裡所有的孩子都一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.56,0:06:48.97,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,他們全都想盡快回到父母身邊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:56.33,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,我們從不同的島聚到這裡來治病。大家的心情都一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.61,0:07:02.32,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,我回家後也有很多想做的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:06.84,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,大家在餅乾室裡和睦相處，\N玩得很開心。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:08.74,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,我們可以忘掉所有痛苦的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:12.83,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,所以你也得好好吃飯，桃之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.26,Flashbacks,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,可是我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:16.89,Flashbacks,Random Yellow suit,0,0,0,,秘密房間的門開著。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:20.79,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,糟了！有人來了！\N我們走吧，桃之助君！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:27.19,Flashbacks,Random Yellow suit,0,0,0,,裡面有人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:29.88,Flashbacks,Random Yellow suit 2,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:30.47,Flashbacks,Random Yellow suit,0,0,0,,那是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:42.07,Flashbacks,2 Random yellow suits,0,0,0,,一…一條龍？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:47.03,Flashbacks,2 Random yellow suits,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:50.16,Flashbacks,Random girl,0,0,0,,桃…桃之助君他…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:52.05,Flashbacks,Random Yellow suit,0,0,0,,看這個。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:56.64,Flashbacks,Random Yellow suit,0,0,0,,貝卡帕庫做的人造惡魔果實\N就放在這個箱子裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:07:59.42,Flashbacks,Random Yellow suit 2,0,0,0,,那不是個失敗的實驗品嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:01.45,Flashbacks,Random yellow suit,0,0,0,,是啊，我也是這麼聽說的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:13.85,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,換句話說，我是人類。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:16.59,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,原來如此。是惡魔果實。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.59,0:08:17.78,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,鰻魚人？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:21.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那你為什麼不變回人類就好？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:27.47,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,咦？我能變回人類？怎麼變？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:31.40,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我不知道。我又不是動物系的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:35.22,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,話說回來，這屋頂到底有多高？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.37,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我看不到我掉下來時穿過的那個洞。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:43.59,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我想從那個洞出去\N把我知道的事告訴那些孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.59,0:08:45.17,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我偷聽到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:48.88,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,…那個叫凱薩的男人真正的盤算。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.83,0:09:01.22,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,又一批乖巧聽話的孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:08.32,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,其他孩子也長得相當不錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:12.73,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,不過，這個實驗在測試\N對這種藥物的耐受極限。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:15.12,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,他們撐不了多久了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:21.20,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,他們全部大概五年內都會死。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:26.39,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,到時候我們再多收集一些孩子就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:29.61,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,不過話說回來，\N每個實驗都會有失敗品。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:31.63,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,這是無可避免的犧牲。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:34.88,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我原以為他是個醫生，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:39.19,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,但事實上，他是個打算讓孩子們去死的可怕男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:44.24,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,我正要去告訴孩子們，\N卻在躲進垃圾桶時掉到了這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:48.78,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,凱薩！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:52.01,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好，桃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.01,0:09:55.38,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我要離開這裡，而且要帶你一起走。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:58.03,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,可是你要怎麼爬到那麼高的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:02.49,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我要爬牆上去。抓緊我。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:06.44,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那些孩子沒事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:09.74,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我的夥伴已經去救他們了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:11.80,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,那是真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:14.99,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他們有辦法搞定的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:17.22,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不必擔心。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:25.98,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,原來如此。你顯然不可能只是個區區的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:28.21,Main,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,海…賊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:29.35,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:33.44,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你真的餓成那樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:34.70,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！振作一點。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:35.60,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}振作一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:40.47,Thoughts,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}{\i1}振作一點！{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:50.05,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們飛起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:59.40,Captions small,Location,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(550,0)}B棟二樓－內部區域，通往診療室的走廊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:03.16,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你覺得他們沒有我也會沒事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:05.90,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不過話說回來，索隆和他們在一起，應該沒問題。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:10.82,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂布魯克，如果找到羅賓要的那副海樓石手銬就告訴我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:16.08,Main,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,請原諒我得仰賴你的妖術了，屍體先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:18.41,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,一切就交給我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:21.23,Captions small,Location,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(400,0)}D棟－SAD製造室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:32.54,Captions small,Location,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(560,0)}B棟－餅乾室附近
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:37.09,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,各位，往這邊走去餅乾室的孩子們那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:41.72,Main,Random Soldier,0,0,0,,好痛啊，老兄！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:43.04,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,別當愛哭鬼了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:44.36,Main,Random Soldier,0,0,0,,別發瘋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:50.76,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,快一點！如果想救那些孩子，就趕快去餅乾室！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:53.72,Captions small,Location,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(570,0)}B棟三樓－餅乾室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:56.59,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好冷！這房間裡有暴風雪！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:59.72,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我才剛脫下外套\N就撞上雪能力者？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:01.50,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,可惡的雪女！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:05.51,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,住手，各位！你們不能吃那種糖果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:07.32,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,快跑，摩卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:11.09,Main,Random giant boy,0,0,0,,別跑了，把糖果交出來，摩卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:13.21,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,不行，大家快清醒過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:16.07,Main,Sind,0,0,0,,別想一個人獨吞。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:17.37,Main,Random giant boy,0,0,0,,別跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:20.37,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我只需要稍微拖住他們一下就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:24.18,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,別來礙事。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:25.97,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.92,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你們去攔住那些孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:40.37,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,敵人是自然系。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.37,0:12:43.12,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我來對付她！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:47.93,Main,Chopper/Nami,0,0,0,,你沒事吧，羅賓？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:50.43,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我沒事，只是擦傷而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:52.70,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我們快去攔住那些孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:54.01,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:57.46,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,娜美，孩子們快要離開房間了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:12:58.74,Main,Children,0,0,0,,等等，摩卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:06.14,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我答應過要攔住他們，\N如果不攔，摩卡就會有危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:07.82,Main,Children,0,0,0,,別跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.82,0:13:09.84,Main,Children,0,0,0,,把糖果給我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:10.96,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,我不會給你們的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:15.47,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,喬巴君告訴我這是什麼樣的糖果。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:18.62,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,你們不能吃這種糖果。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:21.25,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,各位，拜託你們恢復正常！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:28.36,Flashbacks,Sind,0,0,0,,這也是沒辦法的事，摩卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:30.14,Flashbacks,Sind,0,0,0,,我們生病了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:35.79,Flashbacks,Sind,0,0,0,,大人若染上我們的病就會死。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:41.01,Flashbacks,Sind,0,0,0,,如果你的父母死了，你會更難過吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.37,0:13:46.31,Flashbacks,Sind,0,0,0,,他們說一年內就會治好我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:51.57,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,幸會。\N我是凱薩·克勞恩。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:53.84,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,叫我主人吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.84,0:13:59.06,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,你們是我的第一代病患。\N很高興能與你們合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:07.11,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,我曾因這種病失去了我唯一的兒子。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.11,0:14:11.57,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,我再也不想看到孩子受這種病的折磨了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.77,0:14:20.02,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,我也不想看到身為父母的同伴為失去孩子而悲痛。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.19,0:14:27.65,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,啊，請原諒我。讓你們看到我哭，真是難為情。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:30.40,Flashbacks,Mocha,0,0,0,,你還好嗎，主人先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:33.63,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,謝謝你，你真是個善良的孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:40.58,Flashbacks,Caesar,0,0,0,,對了，我還沒把其他來自不同島嶼的生病孩子介紹給你認識。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:43.56,Flashbacks,Uzu,0,0,0,,我是宇津，幸會。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.99,Main,Uzu,0,0,0,,糖果…！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.71,0:14:49.24,Flashbacks,Doran,0,0,0,,我是多蘭。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:52.71,Main,Doran,0,0,0,,等等，摩卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:54.85,Flashbacks,Konbu,0,0,0,,我的名字是昆布。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:58.24,Main,Konbu,0,0,0,,給我一些糖果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.78,0:15:04.29,Flashbacks,Monet,0,0,0,,今天有一些新朋友來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.91,0:15:07.63,Flashbacks,Monet,0,0,0,,你們大家一定要好好相處！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:10.01,Flashbacks,Monet,0,0,0,,如果發生什麼事，可以告訴我。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:11.84,Flashbacks,Children,0,0,0,,好的，莫奈小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.27,0:15:16.48,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,就連那麼親切的莫奈小姐也在說謊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:20.27,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,全都是謊言！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:23.87,Flashbacks,Monet,0,0,0,,這是獎勵你們治療表現得這麼好。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:27.01,Flashbacks,Monet,0,0,0,,主人給的一些糖果。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:32.83,Main,Mocha,0,0,0,,我們大家一起逃出這裡，\N所以拜託各位恢復正常！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.75,0:15:39.07,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們得追上那些孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:40.00,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,就拜託你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.11,0:15:43.85,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你這賤人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:45.61,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你到底在搞什麼鬼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:49.41,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等一下！\N你為什麼朝這邊來？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:51.12,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,等等，娜美！住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:53.44,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,別拿我當盾牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:58.69,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,可惡，沒打中。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.47,0:16:01.48,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你為什麼專挑弱者下手？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:08.72,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,讓開，索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.26,0:16:12.63,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}熱蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:18.22,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,看來熱能有用。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:20.89,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,別再朝這邊過來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:25.09,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,賞金一千六百萬貝里的小偷貓。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.45,0:16:28.03,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,可惡，她又鑽進雪裡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.03,0:16:31.00,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你到底想不想打啊，可惡的雪女？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:33.20,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,出口！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:34.24,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:38.37,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}雪柵欄！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:40.56,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}萬年雪！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.70,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:42.94,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這雪…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:45.59,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好冷，我動不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:51.83,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,她又去追他們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:53.17,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,小心，喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:16:58.83,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}四隻手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:16:58.83,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}四輪花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:00.60,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}拍擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:07.42,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.67,0:17:11.40,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,剛剛真嚇人。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.01,0:17:13.16,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,真麻煩。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:18.19,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,那些孩子是主人珍貴的實驗品，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:23.95,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,而我的任務是保護凱薩和他的實驗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:27.64,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,是誰讓摩卡背叛我們的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:28.60,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:31.33,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那些孩子求我們救他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:33.64,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,讓開，你們這些傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:38.41,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,快走。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:41.22,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我們快點。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:41.92,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:44.51,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,摩卡，再撐一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.55,0:17:48.50,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,真是群沒教養的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:53.27,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,我們日復一日親切地對待他們，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:56.80,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,給他們一個毫無煩惱的生活。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.11,0:18:03.27,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,而你們卻在這裡，企圖從身為監護人的我們手中，奪走我們最重視的東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:07.26,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,你們這些人簡直就跟海賊一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:11.06,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,看來我們意見一致。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:13.15,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,我說了這很沒教養。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.49,0:18:15.51,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,別再妨礙我的任務。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:17.88,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}雪劍！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:20.68,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}肌膚劍！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.15,0:18:30.02,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,你一直都只是在擋我的攻擊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:33.28,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,你為什麼不攻擊我？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:36.44,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,老實說，我本來不認為我能贏過你。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:39.33,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,但情況或許不是那樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.67,Main,Marines,0,0,0,,後面還有另一個房間！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:44.74,Main,Marines,0,0,0,,我們找到孩子們然後離開這裡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.74,0:18:46.43,Main,Marines,0,0,0,,這裡是不是有點冷啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:47.66,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,海軍？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:50.17,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我們走後面那扇門過去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:54.14,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,大家都想搶走那些孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:55.22,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,我不會讓任何人帶走他們。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:56.92,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,衝啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:00.56,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你到底為什麼帶頭啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:04.80,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,喂老兄，孩子不在這裡，但海賊獵人索隆在。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:07.87,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他是個囂張的混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:11.12,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,好，各位。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.12,0:19:14.19,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,把下嘴唇拉下來嘲笑他！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:21.11,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,真希望他們全都在雪上滑倒，撞到頭死掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.79,0:19:25.89,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，娜美和羅賓在那扇門後面。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:27.61,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你們擋路了，趕快給我走。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:31.78,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,哇，你雖然是個白痴，但這倒是個好情報。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:33.87,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,好，我們走吧，你們這些傢…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:37.80,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我本想這麼說，但這裡有位美女！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:39.74,Main,Marines,0,0,0,,不是吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:39.74,Secondary,Marines,0,0,0,,她好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:43.37,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你們這些傢伙真煩！趕快給我先走！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:49.19,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,不過仔細看看。她看起來不像人類。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:50.62,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,人面鳥？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.62,0:19:52.13,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,是哈耳庇厄！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:54.94,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,可…可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.94,0:19:57.70,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,撇開那個不說，她超可愛的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:59.57,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,事實上，這讓她更可愛了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:01.52,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,天啊，她好性感！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.41,0:20:06.06,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你們為什麼這麼禁不起讚美？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:09.29,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,話說回來，為什麼這裡會下雪？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.26,0:20:16.96,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,無論他們是誰，我都不會讓任何人帶走這些孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.95,0:20:35.99,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我的肩膀怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.44,0:20:38.21,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,你這賤人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.45,0:20:48.93,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,她…她是自然系！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:52.00,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,可惡的女人。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:01.29,Main,Monet,0,0,0,,一個會用霸氣的女劍士？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.39,0:21:06.51,Main,Marines,0,0,0,,隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:09.98,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,我暫時阻止了瓦斯進入這個房間。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:16.66,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,不過，它可能會從別的地方滲進來。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.66,0:21:21.39,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,我們時間不多了。\N大家都去追那些孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.21,0:21:23.41,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,你打算怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:27.11,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,我要留在這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:31.27,Main,Tashigo,0,0,0,,我覺得這裡需要我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:33.41,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,咦？！
